; ===============================================================
;  Coupled FODO  —  demo lattice for the IMPACT-X feature trio
;
;  Drives x-y coupling via a 25°-tilted skew quadrupole (TraceWin
;  QUAD field 4 = skew_angle), so the projected ε_x and ε_y oscillate
;  while the eigenemittances ε₁ / ε₂ stay constant under the linear
;  symplectic transport.  Combine with a thermal-halo beam from the
;  matching .lgproj to also exercise the bi-Gaussian distribution.
;
;  Designed for protons, 10 MeV, 325 MHz.
; ===============================================================
TITLE Coupled FODO (skew-quad coupling demo)
FREQ 325
PARTRAN_STEP 100 50
;
; ----- Period 1 (normal-quad pair) -----------------------------
DRIFT 100 20
QUAD 100 15 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
QUAD 100 -15 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
;
; ----- Skew quad (25°) — drives x-y coupling ------------------
QUAD 80 -8 20 25 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
;
; ----- Period 2 (normal-quad pair, weaker) --------------------
QUAD 100 12 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
QUAD 100 -12 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
;
; ----- Second skew quad (counter-rotated, partial restore) ----
QUAD 80 8 20 -25 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
;
; ----- Period 3 ----------------------------------------------
QUAD 100 15 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
QUAD 100 -15 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
;
END
